    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. I'm a bit stuck on the 'complexity' part though. When you say the Renaissance piece shows intellectual complexity through science and perspective, does that imply the African pieces are less 'intellectual' in a formal sense? Like, is there a way to view the tribal designs as having that same level of technical or conceptual sophistication, or are they just inherently different in kind?",
